{"id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-k-axiom.md","title":"K Axiom","display":"df-k-axiom — K Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-k-axiom","aliases":["89-df-k-axiom"],"display":"df-k-axiom — K Axiom","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-k-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-k-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-k-axiom — K Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-k-axiom-—-K-Axiom-(Distribution)\">df-k-axiom — K Axiom (Distribution)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> are fixed by\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}k\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}k\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\)</span> 是 K 公理的全部代入实例，而不是一个含自由元变元的单公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>对<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>有分配性质</li>\n<li>K公理是所有正常模态逻辑的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-k-axiom-—-K-Axiom-(Distribution)","text":"df-k-axiom — K Axiom (Distribution)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-box-modality]] and [[89-df-modal-implication]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-box-modality]] and [[89-df-modal-implication]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}k\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false}],"bytes":866,"backlinks":[{"id":"d306b38c7e186f86","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are the\nK and Löb schemas from [[89-df-k-axiom]] and [[89-df-lob-axiom]]."},{"id":"d2ee1021448dc9af","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the K-axiom schema (see [[89-df-k-axiom]])."},{"id":"bc2c3fb445fcd280","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-k-axiom]])."},{"id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\B